title: Unrest in the Army
subtitle: Reports from the garrisons about the officers loyal to Piłsudski; PPS decides how it answers.
new-page: true
tags: pl_event
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && typeof PolishSecurity !== 'undefined' && PolishSecurity.armyMoodDue(Q) !}
on-arrival: {!
// Event coup.army_mood (Z — 1.10, decision 4A of 8 XI 2026 and the user's note): when the mood of the army first rises to
// "seething" (pressure towards a coup from 40) and to "ready for a coup" (the political crisis from 55), the player learns it on
// the screen, with the causes of the last month and what eases the tension. It changes nothing by itself.
PolishSecurity.armyMoodView(Q);
// Z — 1.24 (decision 8A of 22 XI 2026): the event is a decision with three answers, without this month's action.
PolishSecurity.unrestView(Q);
!}

= [+ pl_army_title +]

[+ pl_army_text +]

[+ pl_army_help +]

- @appoint
- @call_to_order
- @declaration
- @general_strike
- @ignore

@appoint
title: Back a high post in the army for Piłsudski
subtitle: The pressure towards a coup clearly falls, and the Piłsudczycy in PPS are content; the Centre and the Left are displeased, and the army leans a little more towards him.
choose-if: {! return PolishSecurity.unrestStatus(Q, 'appoint').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_unrest_appoint_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishSecurity.unrestChoose(Q, 'appoint');
!}
go-to: result

@call_to_order
title: Call Piłsudski to order
subtitle: We publicly demand that the army keep out of politics. Piłsudski is irritated: relations with him worsen, the pressure towards a coup rises a little, and the Piłsudczycy in PPS are displeased.
on-arrival: {!
PolishSecurity.unrestChoose(Q, 'call_to_order');
!}
go-to: result

# Z — 1.34: the answers of two pairs of the characteristics; hidden without them.
@declaration
title: Declare with the clubs of the minorities that we will defend the Sejm
subtitle: The officers calm down a little, democracy grows stronger, and our relations with the minorities improve. Available thanks to parliamentarism and federalism.
view-if: {! return PolishSecurity.unrestStatus(Q, 'declaration').available !}
on-arrival: {!
PolishSecurity.unrestChoose(Q, 'declaration');
!}
go-to: result

@general_strike
title: Declare that the workers will answer a coup with a general strike
subtitle: The unrest in the army falls, but the right is stirred and Piłsudski is irritated. Available thanks to militarism and strike action.
view-if: {! return PolishSecurity.unrestStatus(Q, 'general_strike').available !}
on-arrival: {!
PolishSecurity.unrestChoose(Q, 'general_strike');
!}
go-to: result

@ignore
title: Wave it off
subtitle: Nothing changes.
on-arrival: {!
PolishSecurity.unrestChoose(Q, 'ignore');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= [+ pl_army_title +]

[+ pl_unrest_result +]

- @root: Continue.
